        <xpdl2:Activity Id="_sUgki8mREe6tB5HEgGPwCw" Name="StopTimerSospesoAppuntamento" FinishMode="Automatic" IsATransaction="false" StartMode="Automatic" xpdExt:Visibility="Private" xpdExt:RequireNewTransaction="false" xpdExt:DisplayName="Stop Timer Sospeso Appuntamento">
          <xpdl2:Implementation>
            <xpdl2:SubFlow Execution="ASYNCHR" Id="_fNLPECEvEeiT7Naqtp1dKg" PackageRef="tim.NOW.bpm.invokeInternalService.Interface" xpdExt:AllowUnqualifiedSubProcessIdentification="false" xpdExt:ProcessIdentifierField="ProcessIdentifier" xpdExt:AsyncExecutionMode="Detached" xpdExt:StartStrategy="ScheduleStart" xpdExt:SuspendResumeWithParent="false">
              <xpdExt:InputMappings MapperContext="ProcessToSubProcess" MappingDirection="IN">
                <xpdExt:DataMappings>
                  <xpdExt:DataMapping xpdExt:TargetContributorId="ProcessToSubProcess.DataMapperContent" Direction="IN" Formal="Scadenza">
                    <xpdExt:ScriptInformation Id="_sUgkjMmREe6tB5HEgGPwCw" Name="Script1">
                      <xpdExt:Expression ScriptGrammar="JavaScript">var Scadenza = DateTimeUtil.createDatetime();&#xD;
&#xD;
var tempo = DateTimeUtil.createTime(0,0,0,0);&#xD;
&#xD;
var one_day= DateTimeUtil.createDuration(true,0,0,1,0,0,0);&#xD;
&#xD;
if(localRequest.ordine.DADRimodulata!=null)&#xD;
{&#xD;
	Scadenza=DateTimeUtil.createDatetime(localRequest.ordine.DADRimodulata,tempo);&#xD;
	Scadenza.add(one_day);&#xD;
}&#xD;
else if(localRequest.ordine.DAD!=null)&#xD;
{&#xD;
	Scadenza=DateTimeUtil.createDatetime(localRequest.ordine.DAD,tempo);&#xD;
	Scadenza.add(one_day);&#xD;
}&#xD;
&#xD;
return Scadenza;</xpdExt:Expression>
                    </xpdExt:ScriptInformation>
                    <xpdl2:Actual ScriptGrammar="JavaScript">__SCRIPT__</xpdl2:Actual>
                  </xpdExt:DataMapping>
                  <xpdExt:DataMapping xpdExt:SourceContributorId="ActivityInterface.DataMapperContent" xpdExt:TargetContributorId="ProcessToSubProcess.DataMapperContent" Direction="IN" Formal="IdRichiestaOLO">
                    <xpdl2:Actual ScriptGrammar="JavaScript">localRequest.IDRichiestaOLO</xpdl2:Actual>
                  </xpdExt:DataMapping>
                  <xpdExt:DataMapping xpdExt:TargetContributorId="ProcessToSubProcess.DataMapperContent" Direction="IN" Formal="FlagAnnullamento">
                    <xpdExt:ScriptInformation Id="_sUgkjcmREe6tB5HEgGPwCw" Name="FlagAnnullamento">
                      <xpdExt:Expression ScriptGrammar="JavaScript">var FlagAnnullamento=&quot;Y&quot;;&#xD;
return FlagAnnullamento;</xpdExt:Expression>
                    </xpdExt:ScriptInformation>
                    <xpdl2:Actual ScriptGrammar="JavaScript">__SCRIPT__</xpdl2:Actual>
                  </xpdExt:DataMapping>
                </xpdExt:DataMappings>
              </xpdExt:InputMappings>
            </xpdl2:SubFlow>
          </xpdl2:Implementation>
          <xpdl2:Performers/>
          <xpdl2:Priority></xpdl2:Priority>
